    {
      "text": "During the Central Continent assault on Lang Ya blessed land, Lang Ya land spirit shouts for Little Five. Gu Immortal Fifth Hair nods, says to watch, and uses an immortal killer move on Heavenly Giant Solor so the silver giant opens its mouth and fires a beam of light that reaches Feng Jiu Ge almost at once. Feng Jiu Ge vanishes from the beam’s path and later advances onto the giant.",
